# [🚙 User reports a Bolt Drive vehicle is parked badly|https://support.taxify.eu/hc/en-us/articles/4426597283346--User-reports-a-Bolt-Drive-vehicle-is-parked-badly] - {color:#ff5630}PC is given as a gesture of goodwill (in addition to the refund which we have to do to their original payment method), so BB wouldn’t be applicable here{color}
# [🚙 User reports they need to return the fuel card|https://support.taxify.eu/hc/en-us/articles/4417845398418--User-reports-they-need-to-return-the-fuel-card] - {color:#ff5630}vehicle reservation fee refund to the original payment method, looks like BB wouldn’t be applicable here{color}
# [🚙 Vehicle state is lost|https://support.taxify.eu/hc/en-us/articles/4410153649042--Vehicle-state-is-lost] - {color:#36b37e}step 1: replace giving RH PC with giving up to 5 EUR to BB{color}
# [🚙 User reports a vehicle warning light is on|https://support.taxify.eu/hc/en-us/articles/4406419738642--User-reports-a-vehicle-warning-light-is-on] - {color:#36b37e}replace giving RH PC with adding small amount to user’s balance (if they were charged for the ride){color}
# [🚙 User reports they cannot start the engine|https://support.taxify.eu/hc/en-us/articles/4403736775442--User-reports-they-cannot-start-the-engine] - {color:#ff5630}full refund to the original payment method required, looks like BB isn’t applicable here{color}
# [🚙 User reported a lost or found item|https://support.taxify.eu/hc/en-us/articles/4402158040850--User-reported-a-lost-or-found-item] - {color:#ff5630}PC is given as a gesture of goodwill (for the user who brings the lost item to the police station), so BB isn’t applicable here as the user didn’t have any charges {color}
# [🚙 User reported there was someone sitting in the car they reserved|https://support.taxify.eu/hc/en-us/articles/360021720199--User-reported-there-was-someone-sitting-in-the-car-they-reserved] - {color:#ff5630}looks like the PC is issued when there were no charges, so BB wouldn’t be applicable here{color}
# [🚙 User reports bad vehicle condition|https://support.taxify.eu/hc/en-us/articles/360021416400--User-reports-bad-vehicle-condition] - {color:#36b37e}PCs can be replaced with BB{color}
# [🚙 User reported issues with fuelling or charging the car|https://support.taxify.eu/hc/en-us/articles/360021415640--User-reported-issues-with-fuelling-or-charging-the-car] - {color:#ff5630}looks like PCs are offered as a gesture of goodwill (when there were no charges), so BB wouldn’t be applicable here{color}
# [🚙 User reports an item is missing from the car|https://support.taxify.eu/hc/en-us/articles/360021415380--User-reports-an-item-is-missing-from-the-car] - {color:#ff5630}manual compensation is issued in those cases, so BB wouldn’t be applicable{color}
# [🚙 User reports an issue with the car keys|https://support.taxify.eu/hc/en-us/articles/360021413940--User-reports-an-issue-with-the-car-keys] - {color:#ff5630}seems like we should issue a refund to the user’s original payment method here, so BB wouldn’t be applicable{color}
# [🚙 User reports they can’t unlock the car|https://support.taxify.eu/hc/en-us/articles/360021438579--User-reports-they-can-t-unlock-the-car] - {color:#ff5630}seems like we should issue a refund to the user’s original payment method here, so BB wouldn’t be applicable{color}

Currently, there are many processes where it’s advised to give a RH promo code to the user (as we don’t have the option to issue partial refunds). I’ll map out those cases as with BB rollout, we can replace promo codes with Bolt Balance.

